Variables

set modMod4setmodMod4setterm foot
set $menu wofi --show drun
Output configuration

output * bg ~/Pictures/Wallpapers/ghost2.png fill
Window rules
Utilities / dialogs float and center

for_window [window_type="dialog"] floating enable, move position center
for_window [window_type="utility"] floating enable, move position center
for_window [window_type="toolbar"] floating enable, move position center
for_window [window_type="splash"] floating enable, move position center
for_window [title="File Operation Progress"] floating enable, move position center
App-specific utilities

for_window [app_id="pavucontrol"] floating enable, move position center
for_window [class="Pavucontrol"] floating enable, move position center

for_window [app_id="pcmanfm"] floating enable, move position 0 0
for_window [class="Pcmanfm"] floating enable, move position 0 0

for_window [app_id="zenity"] floating enable, move position 0 1
for_window [class="Zenity"] floating enable, move position 0 1

for_window [app_id="wofi"] floating enable
REAPER: float on top-left

for_window [class="REAPER"] floating enable, move position 0 0
DISCORD: float on top-left

for_window [class="discord"] floating enable, move position 0 0
SPOTIFY: float on top-left

for_window [class="Spotify"] floating enable, move position 0 0
GODOT

for_window [class="Godot"] floating enable, move position 0 0
